      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ローレンさん、落ち着いてください。\nさらったのは密猟者学園だってわかってるんですから、\nとりあえずみんなで救出に向かいましょう！",
      "jp_sha256": "bfb0149a560136f8e288b6e789fa9b688b7e089e612b447229a34d42aba6b654",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "로렌 씨, 진정하세요.\n납치한 곳이 밀렵꾼 학원이라는 건 알고 있으니,\n우선 모두 함께 구출하러 가죠!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "37709bd3511f2a1175e60be551660748e97b1598451c0d7186fa16c2334da750:000000_-2572681835384468029:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "<Off>",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ローレンさん、落ち着いてください。\nさらったのは密猟者学園だってわかってるんですから、\nとりあえずみんなで救出に向かいましょう！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "463c202fb1d678e1e3c3e3ad1f7505d87b89443a5ffb405df08b9db8ace9be6d",
